h":"/game/109423858328586-1-double-jump-keyboard-escape","slug":"109423858328586-1-double-jump-keyboard-escape","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b76ddb201f9f2b599e2d184649f68c950c5573cf98091395decedce2ed952f81.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f353e898fea8717bd98e85b3338201f0/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":56,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":124230711629351,"name":"[🎃] Danish Voice 🔊","desc":"","path":"/game/124230711629351-danish-voice","slug":"124230711629351-danish-voice","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/35f8c969b08c6f7d2b199a9c3b4cac07ca5c38364f13819cbb782fb2e410b939.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bd2a021c012f18bf37ef5148fef2793c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":56,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":null,"creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":0,"freeCount":0,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":93249115521759,"name":"Slap Battles Tower Defense","desc":"slap\n\nIf Slap battles and Tower defense genre had a child then it would be like this! \nSlap Battles Tower Defense (sbtd for short) is a Tower Defense game themed to Slap Battles!\n\n- Slap enemies for slaps (pro currency name ik).\n- Place towers and upgrade them to defeat the bosses!\n- Buy new towers, and create your own tower empire!\nBecome the strongest in the world.\n\nBeat waves and slap alot of enemies 🧟‍♂️ in order to get super cool shiny stars! ⭐\nUse the stars ⭐ to buy new towers. 🧱 There are over 50!\nLots of towers 🧱 have special powers. 🔮 Try to unlock them all!\n\nIf you've liked the game, you can support us by giving a thumbs up 👍 and a favorite ⭐. It would be really appreciated! 😄\n\nIf you're missing data, check the group forums for info on why or to ask for help.\n\nThumbnails by danny, denny, hrt7l, ron, mortis & demi","path":"/game/93249115521759-slap-battles-tower-defense","slug":"93249115521759-slap-battles-tower-defense","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f595351af5924d9f5357fdb0192caea22f644b8276004dca642ee96c20f31767.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-fe2cc20ceac60c4bc336d65d85d63e4c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":56,"visitor":8945891,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-02-07T21:22:12.181Z","creator":{"name":"The Order Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":94152549783289,"name":"[SKM!] The Urban Line: FreeDrive","desc":"Welcome to the Urban Line: FreeDrive!\nThis game is a branch-off game of the Urban Line Project, where you will get to take part in part of the map!\n\nThe Urban Line Project: FreeDrive features trains and stations from the Hong Kong's Mass Transit Railway (MTR), as of right now, the game operates from Po Lam to North Point and Tiu Keng Leng to Shek Kip Mei. Come and experience being a train operator inside of the network, serve passengers, play announcements, control train doors, everything is under your control!\n\nYou may join a shift through the Server tab in the main menu whenever a shift is ongoing.","path":"/game/94152549783289-the-urban-line-freedrive","slug":"94152549783289-the-urban-line-freedrive","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/54e5275433a62452dceb61e3c301a69a6878cc2c43838ad35872fa0f4625f7de.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d7a05706583a963d766b497d6f6d47f7/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":56,"visitor":3342930,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-19T05:54:00.007Z","creator":{"name":"Cloud Workshop","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":77783763309884,"name":"PARRY!!","desc":"PARRY, the game where you SWING and DASH and PARRY and DASH and SWING AND PARRY\n(version 3.1.0!)\n\nCURRENTLY FEATURINGGG 2 gamemodes, 2.5 weapons, 3 stages (campaign), 2.5 mini stages, 11 unique enemies, and 4 bosses!! if that doesnt sound cool, idk what does.\nAND all the above numbers will go UP with updates.\n\nBASE CONTROLS (in case you forget)\nM1 (R2 or X): melee\nF (R1 or Y): parry\nE (L2): counter\nQ (B): dash\nT (DPadUp): TAUNT\nCTRL (DPadDown): unlock camera\nR (L1): overcharge (but only if you have that upgrade)\nZ (DPadLeft): ability (only if you have that too)\n\nSUPPORTS computer, mobile, and console (at least the xbox controller, tell me if other controllers dont work)\n\n\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\n\nPLAY ABOVE 60 FPS AT YOUR OWN RISK! i forgot that was a thing until i made most the game, so some stuff goes really fast. my bad.\n\nbtw im not selling this game, and i probably never will. if someone is trying to sell it as me, its a scam.","path":"/game/77783763309884-parry","slug":"77783763309884-parry","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0c0d270f14aa3a65b00ec37f0bcd118f152a85f8ce2933633e520e25023f5728.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e27072c978955e0ef476ecbfe02dfa0b/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":56,"visitor":20278046,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-05-02T18:55:23.228Z","creator":{"name":"Red Aircraft","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":9543189030,"name":"[120] Find The Cans","desc":"🎉 Welcome to Find The Cans! Your task is to find as many cans as you can and have a great time. This scavenger hunt experience is an epic adventure to enjoy with friends!\n\n👍 Like, favorite and join the group for new updates!\n\n🎈 Stay in the experience and collect cans to obtain coins. You can buy cool trails with them!","path":"/game/9543189030-find-the-cans","slug":"9543189030-find-the-cans","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/42308651aecfe32ae5a31a9056e750c186e7a3e57ed1d9d42e3e41b64b75b076.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2c9fd8da4a2f7c420778445e43f57019/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":56,"visitor":34293818,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-11-24T19:33:40.540Z","creator":{"name":"Superluminous Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6677423742,"name":"Five Nights At Your Friends [FNAF]","desc":"⚠️ [HUGE UPDATES COMING SOON] ⚠️\n\nCan you survive a night against your friends?\nThis game is basically FNAF but allows you to make the animatronics your friends :D\n\nThis is a fan game of Five Nights at Freddy's.\n\nTags: FNAF, Horror, Five Nights At Freddy's, FNAF Roblox, Friends, Scary","path":"/game/6677423742-five-nights-at-your-friends","slug":"6677423742-five-nights-at-your-friends","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b47dd6f8245b3b744429f0e5f0f06278ead9be0e0fd4f0ff20d2fc27d3c071ef.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-56557ee68d14b7de473d866ba39be612/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":56,"visitor":27771600,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-02-20T15:54:57.436Z","creator":{"name":"Five Nights at Your Friends","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":17123943571,"name":"KJ ARENA","desc":"- Halloween Event is over!\n- Changed base speed and reworked dashes\n- Bug fixes\n\nThis is a Beta version of the game and we hope you enjoyed every destructive attack and high-quality cinematic we have to offer! We still have a lot to finish, such as King & Slap Guy! (eh, you can get early access of both in store tab)\n\nThank you Paul Owen for letting us use your amazing music in our game!\n\n👍 Thumbs up and favorite the game if you liked it!\n\n🖥️🎮Controls:\n[LMB/B2] - Melee\n[1, 2, 3, 4/LB1, LB2, RB2, RB1] Moves\n[F/B4] Block\n[Q/B1] Dash\n[G/DpadUp] Awaken\n[B/DpadLeft] Emotes\n[L3] Console Shift Lock\n[Dpad Right] Lock On\n\ntags: KJ Arena KJ Battlegrounds Battleground","path":"/game/17123943571-kj-arena","slug":"17123943571-kj-arena","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/355b38cf7f13bff964a74353bbb82d0a48e2be2e03c471927594ff64f003ae20.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e5db11ad3b70177c633c562a35bf695b/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":56,"visitor":59894066,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-17T20:05:33.496Z","creator":{"name":"Jex Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":2377868063,"name":"Strucid","desc":"MOBILE VERSION: https://www.roblox.com/games/3632132819\r\n\r\nFight friends and enemies in this insanely addictive shooter game with crazy fun building mechanics!\r\n\r\nQ- Wall \r\nC - Floor \r\nV - Ramp \r\nF - Pyramid\r\nB - Trap \r\nG - Edit\r\nZ - Emote\r\nK - Unlock Camera\r\n*Keybinds can be changed in-game \r\n\r\nThere are no second chances for exploiting. Don't do it.","path":"/game/2377868063-strucid","slug":"2377868063-strucid","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/2b606480280fdbab29f7f01dbfb20bb130f6226fbc3eb88927bc8c763c241a4b.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6beecefea758d87d35ae557ee7263e91/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":56,"visitor":526920165,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-02T17:29:54.632Z","creator":{"name":"Frosted Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":25,"freeCount":25,"keyCount":3,"verifiedCount":2}},{"id":483878848,"name":"Roleplay Universe","desc":"✨ Dive into the iconic Roleplay Universe brought to you by Kavra 💜, previously called Kavra's Roleplay Area. ✨\n\n🌎 Explore 17 AMAZING WORLDS perfect for endless RP scenarios. \n👽 Interact with our imaginative players and NPCs. \n👤 Make new friends and race them on the leaderboards.\n💎 Checkout the large collection of Passes we have to offer, they're fun!\n🏆 Collect Badges by finding characters hidden throughout the worlds and completing tasks.\n\n👏 HAVE FUN, the possibilities are endless and be kind. 🤩","path":"/game/483878848-roleplay-universe","slug":"483878848-roleplay-universe","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4ac78c63db0fbaa494495a79f4f6723e537b2e1e16873110ad9b2ae3f6e5aa37.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3cafe7c33c19978b689006d9e701eef7/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing"